340	     * Derives the region code embedded in an owner's customer code, preferring the postcode: a
341	     * 4-digit postcode falling in a known region's range (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099,
342	     * QLD 4000-4099) yields that region. Otherwise the city-to-region table (Sydney->NSW,
343	     * Melbourne->VIC, Brisbane->QLD) is consulted, returning {@code UNKNOWN} when neither the
344	     * postcode nor the city identifies a region.
