## 3. Service layer + manual validation / side-effects

### 3a. Controller-side manual validation & normalization (all in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`)
These run in `addOwner` BEFORE persistence, in order:

1. **`validateRequiredFields`** (604–625): collects blank `firstName`/`lastName`/`address`(either `addressLine1` or flat `address`)/`city`/`telephone` → throws `MissingOwnerFieldsException(errors)` (400).
2. **`validatePostcode`** (652–667): only if postcode present; must be 4 digits; if city has a known region (Sydney→NSW 2000-2099, Melbourne→VIC 3000-3099, Brisbane→QLD 4000-4099) must fall in range → `InvalidPostcodeException` (400).
3. **`applyAddress`** (882–894) + **`normalizeAddress`** (906–923): prefers structured `addressLine1`/`addressLine2` over flat `address`; trims, collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands ST→STREET/RD→ROAD/AVE→AVENUE; sets `addressLine1`, `addressLine2`, composed `address`.
4. **`rejectFutureRegistrationDate`** (550–554): supplied `registrationDate` after today → `FutureRegistrationDateException` (400).
5. Default registration date to `LocalDate.now()` if null, then **`toBusinessDay`** (566–573): rolls Sat/Sun/public-holiday (fixed 2026 holidays, lines 141–143) forward to next business day.
6. **`rejectWhenDailyLimitReached`** (533–540): if ≥100 (`DAILY_OWNER_LIMIT`) existing owners share that business-day registrationDate → `DailyOwnerLimitException` (429). Uses `clinicService.findAllOwners()`.
7. **`rejectWhenCityAtCapacity`** (514–521): if ≥50 (`CITY_CAPACITY`) existing owners (case-insensitive) in that city → `CityAtCapacityException` (409). Uses `findAllOwners()`.
8. **`applyHousehold`** (821–823) + **`householdId`** (837–852): sets deterministic `householdId = "HH-" + SHA-256("V2|"+lowercased-collapsed-lastName+"|"+postcode)[0:12]`.
9. **`normalizeTelephone`** (708–722) + **`validateNationalNumberLength`** (735–746): strips spaces/dashes/brackets, assumes `+61` if no `+` (drops one leading 0), must match `[0-9]{8,15}`, national-number length must match country code (+61→9, +1→10) → `InvalidTelephoneException` (400). Stored E.164.
10. **`normalizeEmail`** (757–770): null/blank → null; else trim + lowercase; must match `EMAIL_PATTERN` (line 87–88) → `InvalidEmailException` (400); domain in `DISPOSABLE_EMAIL_DOMAINS` {mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com} → `DisposableEmailException` (400).
11. **`rejectDuplicateIdentity`** (784–793) + **`identityKey`** (804–806): computes `IdentityKeys.identityKey(telephone, email, lastName)`; if any non-deleted existing owner shares it → `DuplicateIdentityException` (409). Uses `findAllOwners()`.
12. **`memberId`** (292–309): builds `<V2+REGION><FY2><HASH8><LuhnCheck>`, de-duplicated with `-<n>` suffix against existing `memberId`s (uses `findAllOwners()`). Helpers: `identityRegionCode`/`regionCode`/`regionFromPostcode` (349–391), `identityHash8` (403–417), `fiscalYear` (432–434), `luhnCheckDigit` (318–337).
